1
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:36,000
Dead Again in Tombstone is a western, action,
fantasy film directed by Roel Reiné.

2
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:06,000
The devil’s outlaw and reluctant servant, Guerrero returns from the dead again in
this action-packed western which promises to be one hell of a ride.

3
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:36,000
Guerrero is forced to protect a stolen relic from getting into the hands of Jackson Boomer and his gang of soldiers, but
Jackson will stop at nothing to raise his comrades from the dead and bring the wrath of hell upon earth.

4
00:22:00,000 --> 00:22:06,000
Guerrero must use all his dark powers in order to defeat
Jackson and find redemption…or die again trying.

5
00:27:30,000 --> 00:27:36,000
Guerrero, played by Danny Trejo.

6
00:33:00,000 --> 00:33:06,000
Colonel Jackson Boomer, played by Jake Busey.

7
00:38:30,000 --> 00:38:36,000
Alicia, played by Elysia Rotaru.

8
00:44:00,000 --> 00:44:06,000
Bull Dog, played by Nathaniel Arcand.

9
00:49:30,000 --> 00:49:36,000
Dr. Goldsworthy, played by Dean McDermott.

10
00:55:00,000 --> 00:55:06,000
Madame Du Vere, played by Elizabeth Lavender.

11
01:00:30,000 --> 01:00:36,000
Dead in Tombstone is a 2013 American direct-to-video horror
Western film produced by Universal 1440 Entertainment.

12
01:06:00,000 --> 01:06:06,000
It was directed by Roel Reiné and written by Shane Kuhn and Brendan Cowles.

13
01:11:30,000 --> 01:11:36,000
The film stars Danny Trejo as Guerrero, a gang leader who
gets double-crossed by his fellow gang members.

14
01:17:00,000 --> 01:17:06,000
Striking a pact with the Devil after entering Hell, he resurfaces to the earthly
world to avenge his own death by killing the men who murdered him.

15
01:22:30,000 --> 01:22:36,000
The film was released in home media on October 22, 2013, and was
followed by a sequel, Dead Again in Tombstone (2017).

16
01:28:00,000 --> 01:28:06,000
The film is based on the concept of the deal with the Devil.

17
01:33:30,000 --> 01:33:36,000
The tone is dark.
